title: "AIJIASU2API"
abstract: >-
  An educational and research protocol corpus and reference implementation for
  interoperability study of the AJiaSu / 爱加速 client protocol. It is not
  affiliated with, authorised by, or endorsed by the vendor, and it ships no
  vendor binaries or credentials. This citation refers to the v0.1.0-pre
  pre-release.
